OL,8,G0432 Heart and Soul
OL,9,     FWhen Rimi Tanaka's mother died,
OL,10,     Fshe was writing a book about her
OL,11,     Fsamurai ancestry. Rimi sets out to
OL,12,     Ffinish it hoping to get closer to
OL,13,     Fthe Japanese mother she never
OL,14,     Freally knew.
